                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Parking lot data for Alkmaar. Each parking lot has a calculated total number of available spots, as well as the number of detected cars in aerial images in each parking lot. The number of detected cars as well as the occupancy rate is available for the years 2019, 2020, 2021, and 2022."
                }
              }
